{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras/d8fe5bf41c094b406856605642b44f1c.avif?t=1767939023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras_big/d8fe5bf41c094b406856605642b44f1c.avif?t=1767939023 width=800 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cA true and benevolent God cannot raise a fist in righteous anger; therefore, <strong>the machinations of the Empyrean spill mortal blood in its place.\u201d</strong>\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The war was quick and total. In its retreat, humanity yielded the Earth to angels, fleeing the surface with fearful hearts and fire-scarred flesh. Deep underground, the engineers bred you to be fearless, built you to be fleshless.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Suit up. There is work to do above.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras/4694169557882de5e4718c55ef75ef88.avif?t=1767939023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras_big/4694169557882de5e4718c55ef75ef88.avif?t=1767939023 width=800 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a <strong>potent and varied arsenal of weapons</strong> to take down the angels of the Empyrean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly switch between <strong>aerial and grounded combat</strong> to avoid your enemies\u2019 attacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras/04bc97cbb59e96626ea9adaac5a3c1b6.avif?t=1767939023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras_big/04bc97cbb59e96626ea9adaac5a3c1b6.avif?t=1767939023 width=800 height=115 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>lo-fi vector aesthetic</strong> inspired by line- and vector-graphic arcade games of the 70s and 80s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>unique regions</strong> spanning a vast surface world abandoned by humanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover the secrets</strong> binding together Heaven//Earth; EMPYREAN//YOU.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690170?t=1767939023","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/d9e5d315d22799ab7b8f3183a9fc5a9fbd2803b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767939023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/74b4d34d583d52be67bd8a712480a240ee5d574c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767939023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/74b4d34d583d52be67bd8a712480a240ee5d574c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767939023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras/d8fe5bf41c094b406856605642b44f1c.avif?t=1767939023\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690170/extras_big/d8fe5bf41c094b406856605642b44f1c.avif?t=1767939023 width=800 height=115 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"